WEBVTT

00:00:06.130 --> 00:00:09.040
Sorry for draggin' you out there.

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:11.580
Why...?

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:16.710
You were playing "R-I-O-T," weren't you?

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:33.040
Figured you might be interested in joinin' a band.

00:02:13.670 --> 00:02:19.420
I'm Not Leaving!

00:02:13.920 --> 00:02:20.920
Fire bird!

00:02:21.540 --> 00:02:24.080
"Tsuienu yume e moeagare"
"Burn brightly toward your undying dreams"

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:27.630
Burning up!
Burning up!

00:02:29.250 --> 00:02:30.880
Burning up!
Burning up!

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:35.630
La la, la la la La la, la la la
La la, la la la La la, la la la

00:02:35.790 --> 00:02:38.670
La la, la la la La la, la la la
La la, la la la La la, la la la

00:02:38.670 --> 00:02:45.040
Kurayami de no zetsubou mo douka kowagaranaide
Please, don't be frightened of despair in the darkness

00:02:41.790 --> 00:02:48.040
Wow! Two finalists get to perform...

00:02:41.790 --> 00:02:48.040
Live at the Budokan!

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:48.040
Anata no mune itsudatte...
The shining dream in your heart...

00:02:49.580 --> 00:02:51.380
It's finally begun!

00:02:51.380 --> 00:02:53.710
Even I'm starting to get the jitters.

00:02:53.710 --> 00:02:57.080
Seemed like the audience
was a bit nervous themselves.

00:02:57.380 --> 00:03:00.830
The bands are depending on their votes
to rise through the ranks.

00:03:00.830 --> 00:03:02.880
They aren't used to this.

00:03:03.210 --> 00:03:09.710
Sponsored by Tokyo Live Music Association x Edogawa Music x ESP

00:03:03.210 --> 00:03:09.710
10/11 Location of Prelims

00:03:03.210 --> 00:03:09.710
Participating Bands

00:03:04.380 --> 00:03:06.630
CiRCLE isn't the only one, right?

00:03:06.630 --> 00:03:09.710
Several venues are hosting prelims today, aren't they?

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:10.500
Yup!

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:15.420
Participants can enter at whichever venue they prefer,
and there's no limit on the number of performances.

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:20.170
A bunch of venue and music shop staff
worked together to plan out the whole thing.

00:03:20.710 --> 00:03:22.630
They can perform more than once?

00:03:22.630 --> 00:03:23.710
That's amazing.

00:03:23.710 --> 00:03:26.500
Well, the bands have a better chance
of garnering lots of votes

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:29.710
if they're determined enough
to put on multiple shows!

00:03:29.960 --> 00:03:32.830
Which means us staff have to do our best, too.

00:03:32.830 --> 00:03:33.920
Right.

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:36.080
Thanks for your help today, Yoshiko.

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:38.040
Oh, don't worry about it.

00:03:38.040 --> 00:03:42.670
Galaxy doesn't have any contest entries
or other shows scheduled for today.

00:03:42.960 --> 00:03:45.330
Let me know if you're ever short-staffed.

00:03:45.330 --> 00:03:46.920
I'll drop by and help out.

00:03:46.920 --> 00:03:48.210
Thanks!

00:03:51.130 --> 00:03:53.250
Roselia was incredible!

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:56.210
Who would've thought they'd enter
the BanG Dream contest?

00:03:56.210 --> 00:03:59.500
I mean, RAISE A SUILEN basically
declared war on them...

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:02.040
At this BanG Dream...

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:06.580
we're going to beat Roselia and PoPiPa to a pulp!

00:04:07.670 --> 00:04:11.040
But Yukina-senpai said they
weren't gonna enter, didn't she?

00:04:11.040 --> 00:04:12.920
Voting complete!

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:14.290
Hina-senpai!

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:15.460
I didn't know you were coming.

00:04:15.460 --> 00:04:17.750
We just finished casting our votes for Roselia.

00:04:17.750 --> 00:04:18.830
Who'd you vote for?

00:04:18.830 --> 00:04:20.630
Roselia, of course!

00:04:20.630 --> 00:04:23.580
My big sis killed it!

00:04:25.130 --> 00:04:28.080
Ako's drumming was as flawless as ever!

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:32.080
Roselia's totally awesome!

00:04:34.880 --> 00:04:37.630
Why are we only allowed to vote once?!

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:39.210
I'd vote a hundred times if I could!

00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:42.920
Don'tcha think the votes would get outta control?

00:04:44.290 --> 00:04:45.750
Oh, my gosh!

00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:47.790
Roselia's winning by a landslide!

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:49.000
Huh?

00:04:50.460 --> 00:04:52.500
It's true. They're in first.

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:54.250
No problem!

00:04:54.250 --> 00:04:57.670
Their fame won't last long once RAS takes the stage.

00:04:57.670 --> 00:04:59.380
You're so cool, CHU2-sama!

00:04:59.380 --> 00:05:02.170
According to this, they're scheduled
to perform again tomorrow.

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:05.790
W-we'll beat 'em in no time!

00:05:05.790 --> 00:05:08.920
Wouldn't be so rough if it were
an ordinary tournament.

00:05:08.920 --> 00:05:11.750
That's why we need to play plenty of live shows!

00:05:11.750 --> 00:05:15.460
Yeah. This contest is
a lot more intense than I thought.

00:05:15.790 --> 00:05:19.960
Our goal is to churn out the shows and
attract as many people as humanly possible.

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:22.040
Let's sign up at all the venues!

00:05:22.040 --> 00:05:23.080
Are you kidding?!

00:05:23.080 --> 00:05:24.580
Talk about a full house.

00:05:24.580 --> 00:05:27.380
We're starting out at Galaxy, right?

00:05:27.380 --> 00:05:29.460
We should write a new song!

00:05:29.460 --> 00:05:31.830
Not a bad idea for our
first performance of the prelims.

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:33.040
Hold on just a sec.

00:05:34.210 --> 00:05:35.210
She's serious!

00:05:35.210 --> 00:05:36.380
Shut up!

00:05:38.420 --> 00:05:39.880
Wanna split it with me?

00:05:39.880 --> 00:05:40.880
Are you sure?

00:05:40.880 --> 00:05:41.830
A meat bun...

00:05:41.830 --> 00:05:43.130
You want some too, O-Tae?

00:05:43.130 --> 00:05:44.960
Yeah. Let's split it in thirds.

00:05:44.960 --> 00:05:46.250
Works for me!

00:05:46.250 --> 00:05:47.540
You're awfully calm.

00:05:47.540 --> 00:05:49.830
The Budokan can't be split
like a meat bun, you know.

00:05:50.130 --> 00:05:54.130
It's time to start busting our butts.
Only the top two bands move on to the finals.

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:56.750
Gimme a bite, too!

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:58.000
Fourths, it is!

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:00.250
Me, too!

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:02.830
How 'bout we split it into six pieces?

00:06:02.830 --> 00:06:04.580
You'll eat some, won't you, LOCK?

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:08.540
LOCK...?

00:06:09.710 --> 00:06:12.210
I'm sorry! I zoned out...

00:06:12.210 --> 00:06:13.250
Something the matter?

00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:15.170
N-no, it's nothing!

00:06:15.170 --> 00:06:18.000
Everything's fine! I feel great!

00:06:18.880 --> 00:06:21.080
Um... Oh!

00:06:21.080 --> 00:06:23.710
Wasn't Roselia's performance amazing?

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:27.000
It's like, I could feel this passionate sort of energy.

00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:29.460
They're always so cool!

00:06:29.460 --> 00:06:32.000
Don't you think they're incredible?

00:06:35.630 --> 00:06:37.790
PAREO, once more!

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:39.830
Be more precise with your timing!

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:41.710
Don't fall behind the rhythm!

00:06:41.710 --> 00:06:44.380
But my poor fingers are too tired...

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:45.460
Shut up.

00:06:58.080 --> 00:06:59.330
Excellent.

00:07:01.380 --> 00:07:03.920
What could we possibly be missing?

00:07:03.920 --> 00:07:07.040
Our first performance was perfect.

00:07:07.250 --> 00:07:10.130
So why is Roselia winning...?!

00:07:10.130 --> 00:07:13.580
Are you sure about competing without a guitarist?

00:07:13.580 --> 00:07:15.250
What about the girl from before?

00:07:15.250 --> 00:07:16.710
Her name was Rokka-chan, right?

00:07:16.710 --> 00:07:19.460
Didn't you invite her to join us
because you thought she was good?

00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:22.580
That's what I thought, but her audition was a letdown.

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:27.540
Tae Hanazono

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:27.540
Wanna eat some sweet potatoes?

00:07:27.540 --> 00:07:28.380
Hana-chan!

00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:29.580
Tae Hanazono?!

00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:31.000
Let's call it a day.

00:07:31.790 --> 00:07:33.790
Tell her I said hello!

00:07:33.790 --> 00:07:36.920
No! We're not done discussing this!

00:07:38.750 --> 00:07:41.540
The shop in front of the station
gave me an extra for free.

00:07:42.750 --> 00:07:46.210
You always invite me out at the most random times.

00:07:46.210 --> 00:07:47.540
Were you busy?

00:07:47.540 --> 00:07:48.580
Nope.

00:07:52.710 --> 00:07:54.040
It's good.

00:07:54.960 --> 00:07:57.130
I hear you're in the BanG Dream contest.

00:07:57.130 --> 00:07:58.460
Our prelims start soon.

00:07:58.460 --> 00:07:59.630
Where at?

00:07:59.630 --> 00:08:00.880
Galaxy.

00:08:00.880 --> 00:08:02.250
I see...

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:04.540
We may end up crossing paths
at some point during the prelims.

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:05.380
Yeah.

00:08:06.130 --> 00:08:07.130
I almost forgot!

00:08:07.130 --> 00:08:10.040
That girl who works at Galaxy
came to visit us the other day.

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:12.460
LOCK...?

00:08:14.080 --> 00:08:17.210
Rokka-chan, go ahead and hop in the bath.

00:08:17.210 --> 00:08:18.330
'Kay!

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:31.540
I don't need music that censors itself
to comfort other people.

00:08:34.630 --> 00:08:36.330
Better wash my hair...

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:44.710
Which one is the hot water?

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:49.500
Oh, I'd recommend using
both faucets at the same time...

00:08:52.210 --> 00:08:53.880
Tae-senpai?!

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:55.420
Hey there.

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:05.960
Lately you've been acting a lot like
Oddie when he's hungry.

00:09:05.960 --> 00:09:07.210
"Oddie"...?

00:09:07.210 --> 00:09:10.500
My pet rabbit. He's got odd colored eyes.

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:14.580
He runs into his cage and stares off
into the distance, frozen in one spot.

00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:17.580
Did you play guitar with RAS?

00:09:18.330 --> 00:09:20.170
I heard about it from LAYER.

00:09:20.670 --> 00:09:23.790
Yeah... I failed the audition.

00:09:25.290 --> 00:09:26.670
But it's fine!

00:09:26.670 --> 00:09:31.380
I could never bring myself to squish PoPiPa
into dango. Never in a million years!

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:32.630
Dango?

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:35.670
When she said, "Beat you to a pulp"...

00:09:35.670 --> 00:09:36.790
Oh.

00:09:37.380 --> 00:09:42.630
RAS is nothing like the band
I started back in middle school...

00:09:42.880 --> 00:09:47.330
We used to have so much fun,
messing around and making a racket.

00:09:48.040 --> 00:09:50.790
But RAS is different...

00:09:51.830 --> 00:09:57.380
CHU2-san told me she "doesn't need music
that censors itself to comfort others."

00:09:58.380 --> 00:10:00.210
I was desperate, too...

00:10:02.250 --> 00:10:05.130
Here's hoping you get to perform
alongside RAS again.

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:17.290
Tae-senpai!

00:10:20.210 --> 00:10:22.040
About the new song...

00:10:22.290 --> 00:10:26.710
What do you think of a "reach for the stars,
the sky's the limit" sort of theme?

00:10:26.710 --> 00:10:28.460
As far as the contest goes,

00:10:28.460 --> 00:10:32.670
we don't need to obsess over writing something
spectacular so long as it's got our signature flair.

00:10:33.080 --> 00:10:34.460
Oh!

00:10:34.460 --> 00:10:35.960
Sounds cool to me!

00:10:37.420 --> 00:10:38.920
Y-you think so?

00:10:38.920 --> 00:10:40.880
'Kay, lemme write it down!

00:10:41.500 --> 00:10:42.830
Reach for the stars...

00:10:42.830 --> 00:10:44.790
Aside from the new song,
we ought to decide on our setlist, too.
Reach for the stars...

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:45.580
Aside from the new song,
we ought to decide on our setlist, too.

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:46.630
Aside from the new song,
we ought to decide on our setlist, too.
The sky's the limit...

00:10:46.630 --> 00:10:47.710
The BanG Dream prelims are underway.
The sky's the limit...

00:10:47.710 --> 00:10:49.250
The BanG Dream prelims are underway.

00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:49.670
Reach... Stars... Sky...

00:10:49.670 --> 00:10:52.960
Roselia and RAS are already out there
performing like crazy.
Reach... Stars... Sky...

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:53.250
We should ask LOCK-chan for her opinion.
Reach... Stars... Sky...

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:54.080
We should ask LOCK-chan for her opinion.

00:10:54.080 --> 00:10:55.130
We should ask LOCK-chan for her opinion.
Arisa... that's way too many kanji.

00:10:55.130 --> 00:10:56.580
Arisa... that's way too many kanji.

00:10:56.580 --> 00:10:57.170
I went to see her.
Arisa... that's way too many kanji.

00:10:57.170 --> 00:10:58.210
I went to see her.

00:10:59.580 --> 00:11:01.630
How was she?

00:11:01.630 --> 00:11:04.380
She seemed kinda down the other day...

00:11:04.380 --> 00:11:06.630
Apparently, she failed RAS' audition.

00:11:07.380 --> 00:11:10.670
The hell's their problem?!
After all the trouble they went through to scout her?!

00:11:10.670 --> 00:11:13.880
Is LOCK-chan gonna be alright...?

00:11:13.880 --> 00:11:17.500
I think she wants to perform with RAS...

00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:20.080
but she's worried about them squishing us.

00:11:20.080 --> 00:11:21.290
Squishing us?

00:11:21.290 --> 00:11:22.380
Makes sense...

00:11:22.380 --> 00:11:23.210
Huh?

00:11:23.210 --> 00:11:28.380
She's probably had a lot on her mind lately,
and it's causing her to freeze up.

00:11:28.380 --> 00:11:32.290
When that happens, it's difficult to
snap out of it on your own.

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:35.960
In my case, Kasumi was the one
who helped me bounce back.

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:37.080
Saaya...

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:39.460
I want LOCK to be happy again.

00:11:40.420 --> 00:11:41.670
Same here.

00:11:43.920 --> 00:11:46.880
Listen, about the new song...

00:11:47.080 --> 00:11:48.330
Oh, good idea!

00:11:48.330 --> 00:11:49.710
Sounds like fun!

00:11:49.710 --> 00:11:50.580
Yeah!

00:11:50.580 --> 00:11:52.500
Let's do it together!

00:11:54.080 --> 00:11:56.080
Thank you very much!

00:11:58.710 --> 00:12:00.830
Oh, Saaya!

00:12:01.040 --> 00:12:02.500
Rii-chan-senpai...

00:12:02.750 --> 00:12:05.580
Can I talk to you for a minute?

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:12.630
Forgive me, Chikumagawa...

00:12:12.630 --> 00:12:14.170
I'm doing this for LOCK...

00:12:30.630 --> 00:12:32.630
Catch you at the prelims tomorrow!

00:12:32.630 --> 00:12:33.630
'Kay!

00:12:33.920 --> 00:12:35.040
I'm starving!

00:12:35.040 --> 00:12:36.420
Where should we go?!

00:12:38.580 --> 00:12:40.630
Tomorrow's the big day...

00:12:40.830 --> 00:12:42.420
I can hardly wait!

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:07.420
Like a dream...

00:13:08.710 --> 00:13:11.750
Halloween

00:13:08.710 --> 00:13:11.750
Fair

00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:11.500
The BanG Dream preliminaries are tonight!

00:13:11.750 --> 00:13:16.540
Come see the show and vote for
your favorite band afterwards!

00:13:16.880 --> 00:13:18.000
PoPiPa are-

00:13:18.000 --> 00:13:19.130
Whoops...

00:13:18.670 --> 00:13:22.250
Preliminary Round Lineup:

00:13:18.670 --> 00:13:22.250
Performing live!

00:13:19.130 --> 00:13:21.580
Poppin' Party are in tonight's lineup!

00:13:22.250 --> 00:13:24.330
We're about to get started!

00:13:24.830 --> 00:13:26.330
I'd better hurry...

00:13:30.250 --> 00:13:34.080
The moment of truth.
Our first live show of the prelims!

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:34.710
Yeah!

00:13:34.710 --> 00:13:35.540
Yup!

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:36.380
Yeah!

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:39.380
Here we go...!

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:44.540
Po-Pi-Pa, Pi-Po-Pa, Po-Pi-Pa-Pa-Pi-Po-Pa!

00:13:44.540 --> 00:13:45.580
Thank goodness!

00:13:45.580 --> 00:13:47.040
Hey there, Rokka.

00:13:47.040 --> 00:13:48.170
Asuka-chan!

00:13:48.500 --> 00:13:50.500
Is PoPiPa the only performance tonight?

00:13:50.500 --> 00:13:53.670
My big sis said something about
competing against other bands...

00:13:53.960 --> 00:13:58.790
Most bands participating in the contest
would rather perform at the larger venues.

00:13:58.790 --> 00:14:01.380
PoPiPa's the only act in our lineup for tonight.

00:14:01.380 --> 00:14:02.790
Really...?

00:14:02.790 --> 00:14:05.880
Then who exactly are they supposed to be facing?

00:14:06.250 --> 00:14:09.040
Their... inner demons?

00:14:11.330 --> 00:14:12.920
We're Poppin' Party!

00:14:12.920 --> 00:14:14.420
It's nice to meet you!

00:14:18.830 --> 00:14:22.130
We're insanely excited for our
first performance of the prelims!

00:14:22.290 --> 00:14:26.630
If you enjoy the show, we would be
forever grateful for your votes!

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:30.040
The keyboard and drums...

00:14:30.040 --> 00:14:32.130
Their setup looks kinda different.

00:14:32.130 --> 00:14:35.130
Okay! Let's get poppin' with a brand-new song!

00:14:35.130 --> 00:14:36.080
A new song?!

00:14:36.330 --> 00:14:41.170
This song was written with
a very dear friend of ours in mind.

00:14:42.210 --> 00:14:44.880
Even though she's going through
a tough time right now,

00:14:44.880 --> 00:14:47.750
we wanted to send her
some words of encouragement

00:14:47.750 --> 00:14:51.500
and remind her to never give up
on chasing her dreams!

00:14:51.500 --> 00:14:54.080
The five of us are singing this time around.

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:55.460
Give it a listen!

00:14:57.000 --> 00:14:58.500
"Step X Step"!

00:16:44.540 --> 00:16:45.540
Rokka?!

00:18:04.500 --> 00:18:06.170
I'm begging you!

00:18:06.170 --> 00:18:07.580
One more chance!

00:18:08.130 --> 00:18:11.380
You don't have the strength or skill
to perform with RAS.

00:18:15.920 --> 00:18:16.750
PAREO.

00:18:16.750 --> 00:18:18.080
Y-yes?

00:18:18.080 --> 00:18:19.790
Show our guest the door.

00:18:19.790 --> 00:18:20.830
I'm not leaving!

00:18:20.830 --> 00:18:21.960
What?

00:18:22.670 --> 00:18:25.750
I always wanted to be in a band...

00:18:25.750 --> 00:18:30.130
I wanted to perform alongside people
who I thought were special.

00:18:30.670 --> 00:18:35.540
The other day, I felt like I was beginning to
understand exactly what that means...

00:18:38.170 --> 00:18:40.920
Maybe it's too late...

00:18:40.920 --> 00:18:44.000
But I want to perform with RAS!

00:18:44.290 --> 00:18:47.130
I want to put my entire heart and soul into it!

00:18:47.790 --> 00:18:50.920
I'M TELLIN' YOU, I WANNA JOIN RAS!

00:18:59.080 --> 00:19:01.500
Oughtta at least give her a shot.

00:19:03.290 --> 00:19:04.790
Get in the booth.

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:07.670
Last chance.

00:19:10.460 --> 00:19:12.250
Prepare for playback.

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:13.210
Right.

00:19:17.420 --> 00:19:18.420
Knock 'em dead!

00:19:38.380 --> 00:19:40.580
Oh, I'm getting goosebumps!

